            "block_label": "figure_title",
            "block_content": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Table 3: Task-level results. Failure is the mean of F1–F5 across evaluators (lower better); Overall is the mean holistic-usefulness rating (higher better); Gap is the mean pairwise preference magnitude on a 0–3 scale; Diff. is full minus baseline Overall.</div>\n",
